{"text":"There are more poor Indians on Earth than there are poor Africans. And yet, if you think about the way we think about Africa, we look at Africa in what I call the four horsemen of Africa's apocalypse. We focus on war, disease, poverty, and corruption. Almost nothing good comes out of the African continent. And I'm here today to argue that we, as a global society, must start to look at the African question, and in particular the issue of aid and how we as a global society are trying to address the issue of poverty in Africa in a much more realistic and sensible lens. We have a lot of evidence about what works in terms of creating jobs and creating economic growth. Let's not forget that China has moved 300 million people out of poverty in our lifetime, and we know it wasn't by sitting back and relying on aid. And at the same time, it's not just China, it's India, it's Russia, it's Brazil, and even countries like South Africa and Botswana on the African continent.","words":[{"text":"There","start":0.0,"end":0.58},{"text":"are","start":0.58,"end":0.78},{"text":"more","start":0.78,"end":1.12},{"text":"poor","start":1.12,"end":1.5},{"text":"Indians","start":1.5,"end":1.98},{"text":"on","start":1.98,"end":2.62},{"text":"Earth","start":2.62,"end":2.84},{"text":"than","start":2.84,"end":3.1},{"text":"there","start":3.1,"end":3.2},{"text":"are","start":3.2,"end":3.46},{"text":"poor","start":3.46,"end":3.76},{"text":"Africans","start":3.76,"end":4.2,"punct":"."},{"text":"And","start":4.52,"end":4.52},{"text":"yet","start":4.52,"end":4.8,"punct":","},{"text":"if","start":5.3,"end":5.5},{"text":"you","start":5.5,"end":5.62},{"text":"think","start":5.62,"end":5.8},{"text":"about","start":5.8,"end":6.06},{"text":"the","start":6.06,"end":6.28},{"text":"way","start":6.28,"end":6.54},{"text":"we","start":6.54,"end":7.18},{"text":"think","start":7.18,"end":7.36},{"text":"about","start":7.36,"end":7.64},{"text":"Africa","start":7.64,"end":8.22,"punct":","},{"text":"we","start"